Package: knbsdata
Title: Discover, Retrieve and Cite Official Kenyan Statistics
Version: 0.4.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Mustapha", "Wasseja", , "muswaseja@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R client and standardisation layer for official data and
    statistical products published by the Kenya National Bureau of
    Statistics (KNBS). Provides a consistent interface for discovering
    surveys, publications, aggregate indicators and geographic reference
    data, standardises them into documented schemas, preserves provenance
    metadata such as release dates and checksums, and generates
    reproducible citations. This is an independent open-source project and
    is not an official KNBS product.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
